# A short Battle Tower singles streak (decomp scripts_battle_tower.s, frontier_scripts_battle_tower_corridor.s and
# _battle_room.s): CHALLENGE, SINGLE, three Pokémon picked in order (the party's PARTY_MENU_MODE_BATTLE_TOWER), the
# save before the challenge (both questions YES), the elevator, the corridor and the battle room as frontier scenes,
# two wins (KEEP GOING after each), then RUN in the third battle forfeits it (a loss). The video question NO, the
# record (UpdateGameRecords: best and latest streak 2), the lobby's "challenge ended" and its save. Opponents are
# drawn from the tower RNG, so they differ by seed; the battles' count and results do not.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_LUCARIO 55 platinum:MOVE_AURA_SPHERE
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_STARAPTOR 52 platinum:MOVE_BRAVE_BIRD
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER 15 6 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# CHALLENGE
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# SINGLE
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party 600
+2 screenshot tower-party
+2 tap slot:0
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:1
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:2
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap confirm
until app none 300
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
# The save, then "show you to the battle room" (wait_ab_press)
advance message 1200
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER_ELEVATOR" 1200
+2000 press a
+1 release a
until battle 2000
+0 screenshot tower-battle
battle auto 20000
until menu 3000
+0 screenshot tower-room
+10 press a
+1 release a
+300 press a
+1 release a
until battle 3000
battle auto 20000
until menu 3000
+10 press a
+1 release a
+300 press a
+1 release a
until battle 3000
+0 battle run
until battle 600
+0 battle answer yes
until battle end 3000
until yesno 3000
+2 press b
+1 release b
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER" 3000
advance text 3000
+0 assert battles frontier 3
+0 assert state frontier.towerStreaks[0] {"record":2,"latest":2}
